<span id="A7.T2.5.22.1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.T2.5.22.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">2) </span><span id="A7.T2.5.22.1.1.2.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">def plan_destination(driveable_road_mask, workzone_info)</span><span id="A7.T2.5.22.1.1.2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">: This function should calculate the destination based on the modified road mask and constraints, such as:
- If return_to_original_lane_after_workzone is True, the function should place the destination near the original lane after bypassing the workzone.</span></span>
